  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
    value: <style=title><size=42>LINES
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>27 WAYS</color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>BASE BET: 75</color></size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_1
    value: <style=title><size=32>DIAMOND SYMBOL
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: 'Diamond Symbols are Jackpot Symbols and come in 3 kinds: Blue, Yellow
      and Red.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_2
    value: <style=title><size=32>FIREBALL SYMBOL
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_2
    value: Fireball Symbol appears on spot 5 only and triggers Flaring Fireball Feature.
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_3
    value: <style=title><size=32>FLARING FIREBALL FEATURE
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_3
    value: "- Fireball Symbol appears on spot 5 only.\n- Fireball Symbol triggers
      the followings:\n   - Changes 1 to 3 surrounding symbols to Diamond Symbols.\n
      \     - If non-Diamond Symbol on spots 1 or 9, then it turns to one of the Diamond\n
      \       Symbols: Blue or Yellow or Red.\n      - If non-Diamond Symbol on spots
      2, 3, 4, 6, 7 or 8, then it turns to either Blue or Red.\n      - In case the
      spot is already a Diamond Symbol, then double the Diamond Symbol.\n   - Fireball
      Symbol itself turns to one of the Diamond Symbols: Blue or Yellow or Red."
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_4
    value: <style=title><size=32>JACKPOT DIAMONDS
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_4_1
    value: '- Depending on the number of Diamond Symbols, award relevant Jackpot.

      - Diamond Symbol with the number <color=#ffd200>2</color> on them counts as
      two Dimond Symbols.

      - Diamond Symbols also award progressives.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_4_2
    value: 'ANY 9+ Diamond Symbols awards <color=#ffd200>GRAND JACKPOT</color>

      ANY 8 Diamond Symbols awards <color=#ffd200>300x TOTAL BET</color>

      ANY 7 Diamond Symbols awards <color=#ffd200>100x TOTAL BET</color>

      ANY 6 Diamond Symbols awards <color=#ffd200>20x TOTAL BET</color>

      ANY 5 Diamond Symbols awards <color=#ffd200>10x TOTAL BET</color>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_4_3
    value: '<color=#ffd200>GRAND JACKPOT

      500x TOTAL BET

      75x TOTAL BET

      30x TOTAL BET

      8x TOTAL BET</color>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_5
    value: <style=title><size=32>LOCK & RE-SPIN
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_5
    value: "- Red Diamond Symbol anywhere on spots triggers Lock & Re-spin.\n- When
      Lock & Re-spin triggered, Red Diamond Symbol turns ALL Diamond Symbols to Red\n
      \  Diamond Symbols and they get locked during Re-spin.\n- When triggered, award
      one Re-spin and during Re-spin, only Red Diamond Symbol appears.\n- If additional
      Red Diamond Symbol appears, award one more Re-spin.\n- spin continues until
      no extra Red Diamond Symbol appears."
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_6
    value: <style=title><size=32>INFERNAL FREE GAMES
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_6
    value: "- Yellow Diamond Symbol appears on spots 1, 5 and 9 only.\n- At least
      one or more Yellow Diamond Symbols on each spots 1, 5 and 9 triggers\n   Free
      Games.\n- When Free Games triggered, award 6 spins.\n- Triggering Yellow Diamond
      Symbols become locked throughout the Free Games.\n- In Free Games, only Blue
      and Red Diamond Symbols appear."
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_7
    value: <style=title><size=32>JACKPOT DIAMONDS
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_7
    value: "<color=#ffba00>\u2022 Diamond Symbols are Jackpot Symbols and come in
      3 kinds: Blue, Yellow and Red.</color>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_8
    value: <style=title><size=32>JACKPOT DIAMONDS
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_8
    value: "<color=#ffba00>\u2022 Diamond Symbols are Jackpot Symbols and come in
      3 kinds: Blue, Yellow and Red.</color>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<color=#FFFFFF>3: <color=#FFEA00>{0:CommaNumber}</color>'
